SUMMARY:AVL Rooftop Bar Sunset Meetup 1.0
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Social Club\n**Downtown AVL Rooftop Meetup 1.0**\n\n
 **Join us for an evening of sunset views\, great conversation\, and roofto
 p vibes in downtown AVL!**\n\n**See the plan is to gather to enjoy the sun
 set and visit 2 rooftop bars. Whether coming out for a cocktail\, mocktail
 \, or to see the views\, it’s a great opportunity to see old friends or 
 make some new ones.**\n\n**Tentative plan:**\n* **Meet downtown before sun
 set**\n* **Enjoy the sunset view**\n* **Visit 2 venues**\n* **Relax\, soci
 alize\, and stay for as much of the event as you like.**\n\n**Locations ar
 e TBD. Working on coordination with a couple places to make sure they can 
 accommodate our group before finalizing the itinerary. Once confirmed\, I
 ’ll share the first location.**\n\n**Everyone is welcome\, whether you
 ’re new to Asheville or a seasoned local.**\n\n**Stay tuned for a roofto
 p version 2.0 soon.**
